WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:08.049
What exactly is your
relationship with Robert Berchtold?

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.014
Well, he's practically 
a member of the family.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.599
Good morning, Brobergs.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:18.935
-Good morning, Brother B. 
-Good morning, B.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.020
Good morning, Jan.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.104
It's going to be a great day.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:22.564
Hey, who do you love the most?

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.607
Brother B!

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:34.451
Tell you the truth a man like you, a 
father, and a church leader.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.661
I wanted to be friends with you
from the moment I met you.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:37.787
Really?

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:45.128
I almost feel like we're two sides
of the same family.

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:47.338
I look at you and Mary Ann,

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:50.925
and sometimes I wish 
I had the kind of marriage you have.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.518
If you really care about me, Broberg.

00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:01.770
Help me out, brother.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.440
No one thinks that 
their best friend is a monster.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:09.861
But he has all the hallmarks
of a psychopathic personality.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.072
Happy birthday, Jan.

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:23.083
Robert Berchtold doesn't feel 
emotions the way that we do.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:27.712
He will lie and manipulate

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:29.923
to get the only thing that he wants.

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.510
You remember what I told you?

00:01:34.385 --> 00:01:35.470
You sure are special.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.390
Who is her father?

00:01:40.266 --> 00:01:41.142
Him or me?

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:42.936
Gail?

00:01:43.645 --> 00:01:45.105
If you knew something

00:01:46.231 --> 00:01:47.440
you would tell us, right?

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.237
Your husband kidnaped her again!

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:54.572
Where is Jan?

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:56.241
Where is she?

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.703
There's no telling what 
he is capable of.

